開啟，使用者將能夠搜尋此目錄中的會員','If you confirm, everything related to your profile will be deleted permanently from the site'=>'如果您確認，與您個人資料相關的所有內容都會從網站上永久刪除。','If you do not want to show all members, select only user roles to appear in this directory'=>'如果您不想顯示所有成員，請僅選擇要顯示在此目錄中的使用者角色','If you have extended the functionality of the plugin (e.g sending registered user data to MailChimp via our MailChimp extension, this user info may be passed to these external services. These services may be located abroad and outwith the EU.'=>'如果您擴充了外掛程式的功能 (例如透過我們的 MailChimp 擴充套件傳送註冊使用者資料至 MailChimp)，這些使用者資訊可能會傳送至這些外部服務。這些服務可能位於歐盟以外的國外。','If you like Ultimate Member please consider leaving a %s review. It will help us to grow the plugin and make it more popular. Thank you.'=>'如果您喜歡 Ultimate Member，請考慮留下 %s 評論。這將有助於我們發展外掛程式，使其更受歡迎。謝謝。','If you need to add information or secondary line below the headline of upload box, enter it here'=>'如果您需要在上傳框標題下方添加資訊或輔助線，請在此輸入','If you plan use emails with HTML, please make sure that this option is enabled. Otherwise, HTML will be displayed as plain text.'=>'如果您打算使用 HTML 電子郵件，請確定已啟用此選項。否則，HTML 會顯示為純文字。','If you want to allow specific user roles to be able to filter only'=>'如果您要允許特定使用者角色只能篩選','If you want to allow specific user roles to be able to search only'=>'如果您要允許特定使用者角色只能搜尋','If you want to apply your custom validation, you can use action hooks to add custom validation. Please refer to documentation for further details.'=>'如果您想要套用您的自訂驗證，您可以使用動作鉤來新增自訂驗證。詳情請參閱說明文件。','If you want to enable a maximum number of characters to be input in this field. Leave empty to disable this setting'=>'如果要在此欄位啟用最大輸入字元數。留空表示停用此設定','If you want to enable a maximum number of words to be input in this textarea. Leave empty to disable this setting'=>'如果要啟用此文字區輸入的最大字數。留空表示停用此設定','If you want to enable a minimum number of characters to be input in this field. Leave empty to disable this setting'=>'如果要啟用在此欄位中輸入的最小字元數。留空表示停用此設定','If you want users to go to a specific page other tha