ly'=>'臨時目錄已成功清除','Terms&Conditions Agreement'=>'條款與條件協議','Text Color'=>'文字色彩','Text to display by default in this field'=>'此欄位預設顯示的文字','Textarea Height'=>'文字區域高度','Thai'=>'泰文','Thailand'=>'泰國','Thank you for applying for membership to our site. We will review your details and send you an email letting you know whether your application has been successful or not.'=>'感謝您申請成為我們網站的會員。我們會審核您的詳細資料，並發送電子郵件通知您申請是否成功。','Thank you for registering. Before you can login we need you to activate your account by clicking the activation link in the email we just sent you.'=>'感謝您註冊。在您登入之前，我們需要您按一下我們剛發送給您的電子郵件中的啟用連結來啟用您的帳戶。','Thanks :)'=>'謝謝 :)','That\'s all. If you have any recommendation on how to secure your site or have questions, please contact us on our <a href="https://ultimatemember.com/feedback/" target="_blank">feedback page</a>.'=>'僅此而已。如果您對如何保護網站有任何建議或疑問，請在我們的 <a href="https://ultimatemember.com/feedback/" target="_blank"> 反饋頁面</a>與我們聯絡。','The "unassigned" $status has been removed. Use `UM()->setup()->set_default_user_status()` for setting up default user account status.'=>'已移除 "unassigned" $status。使用 `UM()->setup()->set_default_user_status()` 設定預設使用者帳號狀態。','The <strong>"Membership - Anyone can register"</strong> option on the general settings <a href="%s">page</a> is enabled. This means users can register via the standard WordPress wp-login.php page. If you do not want users to be able to register via this page and only register via the Ultimate Member registration form, you should deactivate this option. You can dismiss this notice if you wish to keep the wp-login.php registration page open.'=>'一般設定<a href="%s「>頁面</a>上的<strong>」會員 - 任何人都可以註冊"</strong>選項已啟用。這表示使用者可以透過標準的 WordPress wp-login.php 頁面註冊。如果您不希望使用者可以透過這個頁面來註冊，而只希望透過終極會員註冊表單來註冊，您應該停用這個選項。如果您希望保留 wp-login.php 註冊頁面，您可以取消此通知。','The administrator has not yet approved deleting your data. Please expect an email with a link to your data.'=>'管理員尚未核准刪除您的資料。請期待一封附有您資料連結的電子郵件。','The administrator has not yet approved downloading the data. Please expect an email with a link to your data.'=>'管理員尚未核准下載資料。請期待一封附有資料連結的電子郵件。','The affected user accounts will be flagged as suspicious when they update their Profile/Account. If you are not using these capabilities, you may remove them from the roles in the <a target="_blank" href="%s">User Role settings</a>.'=>'受影響的使用者帳戶在更新個人資料/帳戶時會被標記為可疑。如果您不使用這些功能，您可以從 <a target="_blank" href="%s"> 使用者角色設定</a>中的角色移除這些功能。','The core admin role must always have access to wp-admin / WordPress backend'=>'核心管理員角色必須永遠擁有 wp-admin / WordPress 後端的存取權限。','The default WordPress Register form is disabled.'=>'預設 WordPress 註冊表單已停用。','The default WordPress Register form is enabled. If you\'re getting Spam User Registrations, we recommend that you enable a Challenge-Response plugin such as our <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/um-recaptcha/" target="_blank">Ultimate Member - Google reCAPTCHA</a> extension.'=>'預設 WordPress 註冊表單已啟用。如果您收到垃圾使用者註冊，我們建議您啟用一個 Challenge-Response 外掛程式，例如我們的 <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/um-recaptcha/" target="_blank">Ultimate Member - Google reCAPTCHA</a> 延伸。','The display format of the date which is visible to user.'=>'使用者可看到的日期顯示格式。','The easiest way to create powerful online communities and beautiful user profiles with WordPress'=>'使用 WordPress 建立功能強大的線上社群及美觀的使用者個人資料最簡單的方式。','The email you entered is incorrect'=>'您輸入的電子郵件不正確','The end of date range must be greater than the start of date range'=>'日期範圍的結束必須大於日期範圍的開始','The field label is the text that appears above the field on your front-end form. Leave blank to not show a label above field.'=>'欄位標籤是顯示在前端表單欄位上方的文字。留空表示欄位上方不顯示標籤。','The flagged capabilities are related to the following roles: '=>'標記的能力與下列角色相關：','The form has been duplicated successfully.'=>'表格已成功複製。','The global default of profile photo size. This can be overridden by individual form settings.'=>'個人檔案相片大小的全局預設值。這可以由個別表格設定覆寫。','The global default width of cover photo size. This can be overridden by individual form settings.'=>'封面照片尺寸的全局預設寬度。這可以由個別表格設定覆寫。','The height of textarea in pixels. Default is 100 pixels'=>'文字區域的高度，單位為像素。預設為 100 像素','The higher the number, the higher the priority'=>'數字越大，優先順序越高','The key you entered belongs to a bundle, please use the product specific license key.'=>'您輸入的金鑰屬於套件，請使用產品特定的授權金鑰。','The link you followed has expired.'=>'您遵循的連結已過期。','The maximum size for image that can be uploaded through this field. Leave empty for unlimited size.'=>'可透過此欄位上傳影像的最大尺寸。留空表示大小不限。','The maximum width of shortcode in pixels e.g. 600px'=>'簡碼的最大寬度（像素），例如 600px','The maximum width of the profile area inside profile (below profile header)'=>'剖面內剖面區域的最大寬度 (在剖面標頭下方)','The maximum width of the profile area inside profile (below profile header).'=>'剖面內剖面區域的最大寬度（剖面標頭下方）。','The maximum width this shortcode can take from the page width.'=>'此短碼可從頁面寬度中取得的最大寬度。','The meta key cannot be changed for duplicated fields or when editing an existing field. If you require a different meta key please create a new field.'=>'重複欄位或編輯現有欄位時，無法變更元索引鍵。如果您需要不同的元關鍵，請建立新欄位。','The password you entered is incorrect.'=>'您輸入的密碼不正確。','The role selected in "Ultimate Member > Settings > Appearance > Registration Form > Registration Default Role" setting has Administrative capabilities.'=>'在「終極會員 > 設定 > 外觀 > 註冊表單 > 註冊預設角色」設定中選擇的角色具有管理功能。','The role selected in WordPress native "Settings > New User Default Role" setting has Administrative capabilities.'=>'在 WordPress 原生「設定 > 新使用者預設角色」設定中選擇的角色具有管理功能。','The secondary email cannot be the same as primary'=>'次要電子郵件不能與主要電子郵件相同','The selected icon is using an outdated version. Please select the icon above to use latest version.'=>'所選圖示使用的是過時版本。請選擇上面的圖示以使用最新版本。','The shortcode is centered by default unless you specify otherwise here'=>'除非您在此另行指定，否則簡碼預設居中','The shortcode is centered by default unless you specify otherwise here.'=>'除非您在此另行指定，否則簡碼預設為居中。','The text that appears on the button. e.g. Upload'=>'顯示在按鈕上的文字，例如上傳','The text that is used for cancelling update profile button.'=>'用於取消更新設定檔按鈕的文字。','The text that is used for primary button text.'=>'用於主要按鈕文字的文字。','The text that is used for the secondary button text.'=>'用於次要按鈕文字的文字。','The text that is used for updating profile button.'=>'用於更新設定檔按鈕的文字。','The username you entered is incorrect'=>'您輸入的使用者名稱不正確','The using meta keys from restricted list in Ultimate Member Forms may break the website\'s functionality and is unsecure.'=>'在 Ultimate Member Forms 中使用限制清單中的元金鑰可能會破壞網站的功能，而且不安全。','Theme path - '=>'佈景主題路徑 - ','Theme version'=>'佈景主題版本','Theme version is empty'=>'佈景主題版本為空','Theme version is out of date'=>'佈景主題版本太過老舊','Theme version up to date'=>'佈景主題版本為最新版本','Themes are up to date.'=>'主題是最新的。','There are '=>'有','There are %1$s inactive %2$s license keys for this site. This site is not authorized to get plugin updates. You can activate this site on <a href="https://ultimatemember.com/">www.ultimatemember.com</a>.'=>'此網站有 %1$s 無效的 %2$s 授權金鑰。此網站未獲授權取得外掛程式更新。您可以在 <a href="https://ultimatemember.com/">www.ultimatemember.com</a> 上啟用此網站。','There are no issues found in the Site Health status'=>'網站健康狀態沒有發現任何問題','There was an error with this license key: %1$s%2$s. Please <a href="%3$s">contact our support team</a>.'=>'此授權金鑰出現錯誤：%1$s%2$s。請 <a href="%3$s">聯絡我們的支援團隊</a>。','There was an error with this license key: %1$s. Please <a href="%2$s">contact our support team</a>.'=>'此許可金鑰出現錯誤：%1$s。請 <a href="%2$s">聯絡我們的支援團隊</a>。','There\'s %d issue in the Site Health status'=>'網站健康狀態有 %d 問題' . "\0" . '','There\'s %d plugin that requires an update.'=>'有 %d 外掛程式需要更新。' . "\0" . '','There\'s %d theme that requires an update.'=>'有 %d 主題需要更新。' . "\0" . '','There\'s a new version of WordPress.'=>'WordPress 有了新版本。','These features are either experimental or incomplete, enable them at your own risk!'=>'這些功能都是實驗性的或不完整的，啟用這些功能的風險由您自行承擔！','These features are related to the legacy logic or functionality. Please enable them only for the backward compatibility.'=>'這些功能與傳統邏輯或功能有關。請僅為了向下相容性而啟用它們。','Thickness (in pixels)'=>'厚度（像素）','This action has been prevented for security measures.'=>'基於安全措施，此動作已被阻止。','This activation link is expired or have already been used.'=>'此啟動連結已過期或已被使用。','This activation link is expired.'=>'此啟動連結已過期。','This appears to be an invalid license key for %s.'=>'%s 的授權金鑰無效。','This block cannot be used on this page'=>'此區塊不能用於此頁面','This content has been restricted to logged-in users only. Please <a href="{login_referrer}">log in</a> to view this content.'=>'此內容僅限已登入的使用者觀看。請<a href="{login_referrer}">登入</a>以檢視此內容。','This controls the display of field icons in the login form.'=>'此項控制登入表單中欄位圖示的顯示。','This controls the display of field icons in the registration form.'=>'此功能控制註冊表單中欄位圖示的顯示。','This controls the REST API version, we recommend to use the last version.'=>'此控制 REST API 版本，我們建議使用最新版本。','This debug information about Ultimate Member directories.'=>'有關 Ultimate Member 目錄的除錯資訊。','This debug information about user role.'=>'有關使用者角色的除錯資訊。','This debug information about user roles.'=>'此為使用者角色的除錯資訊。','This debug information for your Ultimate Member directory.'=>'此為您的 Ultimate Member 目錄的除錯資訊。','This debug information for your Ultimate Member form.'=>'此為您的 Ultimate Member 表格的除錯資訊。','This debug information for your Ultimate Member forms.'=>'此調試資訊適用於您的 Ultimate Member 表單。','This debug information for your Ultimate Member installation can assist you in getting support.'=>'此 Ultimate Member 安裝的除錯資訊可協助您取得支援。','This decides which years should be shown relative to today date'=>'這會決定哪些年份應該顯示相對於今天的日期','This email address has been blocked.'=>'此電子郵件地址已被封鎖。','This feature scans for suspicious registered accounts, bans the usage of administrative capabilities to site subscribers/members, allows the website administrators to force all users to reset their passwords, preventing users from logging-in using their old passwords that may have been exposed.'=>'此功能可掃描可疑的註冊帳戶、禁止網站訂閱者/會員使用管理功能、允許網站管理員強制所有使用者重設密碼，防止使用者使用可能已暴露的舊密碼登入。','This field doesn\'t support image crop'=>'此欄位不支援影像裁切','This field is not setup correctly for this form.'=>'此表格的此欄位設定不正確。','This field is required'=>'這是必填欄位','This field must contain at least %s characters'=>'這個欄位必須至少 %s 個字元','This field must contain less than %s characters'=>'這個欄位必須少於 %s 個字元','This field type is not setup correctly.'=>'此欄位類型未正確設定。','This file has been removed.'=>'這個檔案已移除。','This file is too large!'=>'這個檔案大小太大。','This file is too small!'=>'這個檔案大小太小。','This file type is not recognized.'=>'無法識別此檔案類型。','This image is too large!'=>'這張圖片尺寸太大。','This image is too small!'=>'這張圖片尺寸太小。','This is applicable for edit mode only.'=>'這只適用於編輯模式。','This is not a valid email'=>'這不是有效的電子郵件地址','This is not permitted for security reasons. For your safety, please remove it.'=>'基於安全理由，這是不允許的。為了您的安全，請移除它。','This is not possible for security reasons.'=>'基於安全理由，這並不可能。','This is not possible for security reasons. Don\'t use internal PHP functions.'=>'基於安全理由，這是不可能的。不要使用 PHP 內部函數。','This is not your password'=>'這不是您的密碼','This is the custom text that will be displayed to users before they delete their account from your website when no password is required to confirm account deletion.'=>'這是自訂文字，當使用者在您的網站上刪除帳號時，不需要密碼確認帳號刪除，就會在使用者刪除帳號前顯示給使用者。','This is the custom text that will be displayed to users before they delete their account from your website when their password is required to confirm account deletion.'=>'這是自訂文字，當使用者在您的網站上刪除帳號前，需要密碼確認刪除帳號時，會顯示給使用者。','This is the headline that appears in the upload box for this field'=>'這是此欄位上載方塊中出現的標題','This is the line-style of divider'=>'這是分割線的線型','This is the max number of entries the user can add via field group.'=>'這是使用者可以透過欄位群組新增的最大項目數量。','This is the message shown to users that do not have permission to view the block\'s content.'=>'這是顯示給沒有權限檢視區塊內容的使用者的訊息。','This is the message shown to users that do not have permission to view the content.'=>'這是顯示給沒有權限檢視內容的使用者的訊息。','This is the name that will be displayed for users on the front end of your site. Default setting uses first/last name as display name if it exists.'=>'這是使用者在網站前端顯示的名稱。預設設定會使用名/姓作為顯示名稱 (如果存在的話)。','This is the required spacing in pixels. e.g. 20px'=>'這是以像素為單位的所需間距，例如 20px。','This is the text that appears in a tooltip when a user hovers over the info icon. Help text is useful for providing users with more information about what they should enter in the field. Leave blank if no help text is needed for field.'=>'這是使用者將滑鼠移至資訊圖示上時，出現在工具提示中的文字。說明文字有助於提供使用者更多資訊，讓他們知道應該在欄位中輸入什麼。如果欄位不需要說明文字，請留空。','This is the text that appears within the field e.g please enter your email address. Leave blank to not show any placeholder text.'=>'這是顯示在欄位中的文字，例如：請輸入您的電子郵件地址。留空不顯示任何占位符文字。','This is the text that is displayed if no users are found during a search'=>'如果在搜尋過程中沒有找到使用者，則會顯示此文字','This is the title of the field for your reference in the backend. The title will not appear on the front-end of your website.'=>'這是欄位的標題，供您在後台參考。標題不會顯示在您網站的前端。','This is the title that is displayed on a specific user profile.'=>'這是顯示在特定使用者個人資料上的標題。','This is the width in pixels, e.g. 4 or 2, etc'=>'這是以像素為單位的寬度，例如 4 或 2 等。','This label is the text that appears above the confirm password field. Leave blank to show default label.'=>'此標籤是出現在確認密碼欄位上方的文字。留空顯示預設標籤。','This link leads to a 3rd-party website. Make sure the link is safe and you really want to go to this website: \'%s\''=>'此連結會指向第三方網站。請確定連結是安全的，而且您確實想要前往此網站：\'%s\'','This media type is not recognized.'=>'無法識別此媒體類型。','This option adds rate limit when submitting the change password form in the Account page. Users are only allowed to submit 1 request per 30 minutes to prevent from any brute-force attacks or password guessing with the form.'=>'此選項增加了在帳戶頁面提交更改密碼表單時的速率限制。每 30 分鐘只允許使用者提交 1 次請求，以防止任何暴力攻擊或使用表單猜測密碼。','This option allows you to pre-fill the field with a default value prior to the user entering a value in the field. Leave blank to have no default value'=>'此選項允許您在使用者在欄位中輸入數值之前，預先在欄位中填入預設值。留空表示沒有預設值','This option allows you to set whether or not the user can edit the information in this field. The site admin can edit all fields regardless of the option set here.'=>'此選項可讓您設定使用者是否可以編輯此欄位的資訊。無論在此設定的選項為何，網站管理員都可以編輯所有欄位。','This option allows you to set whether the field must be filled in before the form can be processed.'=>'此選項可讓您設定是否必須填寫欄位才能處理表格。','This option lets you specify blacklist of words to prevent anyone from signing up with such a word as their username.'=>'此選項可讓您指定字詞黑名單，以防止任何人使用此類字詞作為其使用者名稱註冊。','This option lets you specify the choice callback functions to prevent anyone from using 3rd-party functions that may put your site at risk.'=>'此選項可讓您指定選擇的回呼函數，以防止任何人使用可能會使您的網站遭受風險的第三方函數。','This option makes possible to reset password only for approved user. Is used to prevent from any spam email attacks from not approved users.'=>'此選項只可讓已核准的使用者重設密碼。用來防止未經核准使用者的垃圾郵件攻擊。','This option overrides "Date User-Friendly Format" option. See https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php'=>'此選項覆寫「日期使用者友善格式」選項。請參閱 https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php','This page allows you to manage user upload options, enabling you to optimize photos for your site.'=>'此頁可讓您管理使用者上傳選項，使您能優化網站的相片。','This prevents all users from registering with Ultimate Member on your site.'=>'這會阻止所有使用者在您的網站上註冊 Ultimate Member。','This prevents brute-force enumeration attempts in guest AJAX requests.'=>'這可以防止訪客 AJAX 請求中的暴力枚舉嚐試。','This section allows you to customize the profile photo component on the user profile.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者個人資料上的個人資料照片元件。','This section allows you to customize the user login buttons and fields layout.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者登入按鈕和欄位版面。','This section allows you to customize the user login template and size.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者登入的範本和大小。','This section allows you to customize the user profile buttons and fields layout.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者設定檔按鈕和欄位版面。','This section allows you to customize the user profile header component.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者設定檔標頭元件。','This section allows you to customize the user profile template and size. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Learn more about custom profile template creation</a>.'=>'本節允許您自訂使用者個人資料範本和大小。<a href="%s" target="_blank">進一步瞭解自訂個人資料範本的建立</a>。','This section allows you to customize the user profiles menus on your site.'=>'本節可讓您自訂網站上的使用者個人資料選單。','This section allows you to customize the user registration buttons and fields layout.'=>'本節允許您自訂使用者註冊按鈕和欄位佈局。','This section allows you to customize the user registration template and size.'=>'本節可讓您自訂使用者註冊範本和大小。','This section enables you to assign a page to one of the core elements necessary for the plugin\'s proper function. The plugin automatically creates and configures the required pages upon installation.<br />You only need to use this tab if you accidentally deleted pages that were automatically created during the initial plugin activation. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Learn more about manually creating pages</a>.'=>'本節可讓您為外掛正常運作所需的核心元素之一指定頁面。外掛會在安裝時自動建立和設定所需的頁面。<br />只有在您不小心刪除在初始外掛啟動時自動建立的頁面時，才需要使用此標籤。<a href="%s" target="_blank">瞭解更多關於手動建立頁面的資訊</a>。','This section is designed to help you integrate Ultimate Member functionality with Google Maps API.'=>'本節旨在幫助您將 Ultimate Member 功能與 Google Maps API 整合。','This section is designed to modify settings that are tailored for developers. If you are not a developer, please be cautious when changing these settings.'=>'本節旨在修改專為開發人員設計的設定。如果您不是開發人員，請謹慎變更這些設定。','This user account status is %s'=>'此使用者帳號狀態為 %s','This user could not be approved.'=>'無法核准此使用者。','This user could not be deactivated.'=>'無法停用此使用者。','This user could not be reactivated.'=>'無法重新啟動此使用者。','This user could not be rejected.'=>'無法拒絕此使用者。','This user could not be set as pending review.'=>'無法將此使用者設定為待審核。','This user has not added any information to their profile yet.'=>'該使用者尚未在個人資料中加入任何資訊。','This user has not created any posts.'=>'此使用者尚未建立任何文章。','This user has not made any comments.'=>'此使用者未提出任何意見。','This version of <strong>"%1$s"</strong> requires the core <strong>%2$s</strong> plugin to be <strong>%3$s</strong> or higher.'=>'此版本的 <strong>"%1$s"</strong> 需要核心 <strong>%2$s</strong> 外掛為 <strong>%3$s</strong> 或更高版本。','This will be the background of entire section'=>'這將是整個章節的背景','This will be the background of the heading section'=>'這將會是標題部分的背景','This will be the color of selected icon. By default It will be the same color as heading text color'=>'這將是選取圖示的顏色。預設為與標題文字顏色相同。','This will be the default tab on user profile page.'=>'這將會是使用者個人資料頁面的預設索引標籤。','This will be the default template to output login.'=>'這將會是輸出登入的預設範本。','This will be the default template to output profile.'=>'這將是輸出設定檔的預設範本。','This will be the default template to output registration.'=>'這將會是輸出註冊的預設範本。','This will be the minimum width for cover photo uploads.'=>'這將是上傳封面照片的最小寬度。','This will be the role assigned to users registering through Ultimate Member registration forms. By default, this setting will follow the core WordPress setting "New User Default Role" unless you specify a different role.'=>'這將是指派給透過 Ultimate Member 註冊表單註冊的使用者的角色。預設情況下，除非您指定不同的角色，否則此設定將遵循 WordPress 核心設定「新使用者預設角色」。','This will be the text color of entire section'=>'這將會是整個區段的文字顏色','This will be the text color of heading part only'=>'這只會是標題部分的文字顏色','This will be used in the meta description that is available for search-engines.'=>'這將用於供搜尋引擎使用的 meta 描述中。','This will block the specified email addresses from being able to sign up or sign in to your site. To block an entire domain, use something like `*@domain.com`.'=>'這將封鎖指定的電子郵件地址，使其無法註冊或登入您的網站。若要封鎖整個網域，請使用類似 `*@domain.com`。','This will log out all users on your site and forces them to reset passwords <br/>when <strong>"Display Login form notice to reset passwords" is enabled/checked.</strong>'=>'當 <strong>「顯示登入表單通知以重設密碼」啟用/勾選時，這將登出您網站上的所有使用者，並強制他們重設密碼。','This will permanently delete this custom field from a database and from all forms on your site. Are you sure?'=>'這將從資料庫和您網站上的所有表單中永久刪除此自訂欄位。您確定嗎？','Thursday'=>'星期四','Tibetan'=>'藏文','Tigrinya'=>'提格利尼亞文','TikTok'=>'TikTok','TikTok URL'=>'TikTok 網址','TIME'=>'時間','Time Format'=>'時間格式','Time Inte